    "proximate_text": "The direct cause of the event was a failure of the HPCS over-frequency relay. The HPCS original system design included an over-frequency relay that is not required. This feature has existed since construction, and its need was not evaluated after HPCS was built without the Level-8 injection valve isolation bypass signal, per the GE system design criteria.",
